samurai-code-power-name = Code of Power
samurai-code-power-desc = Power is a great sign of honor, to carry a sign of power is to show the world you carry your honor proudly, and to have none is to know your dishonor.

samurai-code-death-name = Code of Death
samurai-code-death-desc = Death is sacred, to rob someone of it is to rob them of their honour.

samurai-code-sanctity-name = Code of Sanctity
samurai-code-sanctity-desc = The body is a temple, to taint it is to dishonor the spirit.

samurai-code-display-name = Code of Display
samurai-code-display-desc = To hide yourself is to know you have no honor.

samurai-code-nature-name = Code of Nature
samurai-code-nature-desc = The natural world is divine, and must be cleansed and protected.

samurai-code-pride-name = Code of Pride
samurai-code-pride-desc = The honorable are divinely granted the responsibility to guide the weak, and to spread their wisdom. To fail that responsibility is a great dishonor.

samurai-code-conquest-name = Code of Conquest
samurai-code-conquest-desc =  If fighting is sure to result in victory, then you must fight; if fighting will not result in victory, then you must not.

samurai-code-war-name = Code of War
samurai-code-war-desc =  If fighting is sure to result in victory, then you must fight; if fighting will not result in victory, then you must not.